{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41928","headline":"柴司徒宅牡丹 · 李中","name":"柴司徒宅牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮春栏槛有佳期，公子开颜乍拆时。\n翠幄密笼莺未识，好香难掩蝶先知。\n愿陪妓女争调乐，欲赏宾朋预课诗。\n只恐却随云雨去，隔年还是动相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}